<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ICG Communications.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ICG Communications.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it upgraded ICG Communications Inc to buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- &quot;we believe that demand is stronger and the prospects for improved provisioning are better than investors fully appreciate,&quot; a Lehman summary report said.</p>
<p>-- the stock was off 3/16 at 19-5/16.</p>
</text>
